Given \(h\in\ker(A_P)\), form \(r^h\); choose \(\rho_x\) supported on \(J_x\), positive there, and summing to one; put
\[
d^h_{s,a}(x,u,w)=
\begin{cases}
\displaystyle \rho_x(w)\frac{r^h_a(x,u)-r^h_{a_s}(x,u)}{C_x(w\mid u)},&w\in J_x,\\
0,&w\notin J_x;
\end{cases}
\]
apply \(\Gamma_{s,x,u,w,a_s}\) on \(J_x\), set \(\Delta^h_{s,x,u,w}=0\) off \(J_x\), and replace \(K_{s,x,u,w}\) by \(K_{s,x,u,w}+\varepsilon\Delta^h_{s,x,u,w}\) for \(|\varepsilon|<\varepsilon_*(h)\).
